	(text "GP0: BED_DATA, a half-duplex UART on one wire (PIO).\nGP1: BED_PROBE, high = OK; low when armed and the beam's\nedge is seen. On the plot bed board it is in series with\nthe touch line (Q952): Klipper's probe pin, no relay in\nfirmware. DETECT: the ID resistor only.\nGP28/29 (ADC2/3): free, for a second pair later."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 91.44 99.06 0)
		(effects
