	(text "Two slots in an L, on the bed outside the paper area (it moves with the bed). Each slot 15 mm long,\nan IR LED at one end, a PT1206BS at the other (on its side: it is top-view), each behind a slit.\nX beam: along Y, crossed by moving in X. Y beam: along X, crossed in Y. The pen does the L.\nSlits: two razor-blade edges, 0.2-0.3 mm apart, narrow across the pen's travel. Beam 1-2 mm over the bed:\ncrossed 0.5-1.5 mm over the tip (its z from the load cell). Measure Y first, then cross X at every\npen's same spot along the beam (a beam off square reads X off by its angle). Notes: limn/TODO.md, break-beam."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 198.12 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c7b51c1f-6f49-44e5-95ab-3cc53d3de648")
	)
